    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔλιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span> I)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to folds,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστὴρ αὔλιος</span> 'star <i>that bids
				the shepherd fold',</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1630
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				539
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν αὐλίοις συρίζῃς, ὦ
				Πάν, τοῖς σοῖσιν ἐν ἄντροις</span> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				500
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔλιος θύρα</span> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				546
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλία θύρα: πυλών,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
